<h1>Your Account Has Been Deactivated</h1>

<p>Hi {{name}},</p>

<p>
  Your Epilink account has been <strong>deactivated</strong>. You will not be able
  to log in until your account is reactivated by an administrator or your supervisor.
</p>

<div class="alert-box">
  <p>&#9888; Account status: <strong>Inactive</strong></p>
</div>

<hr class="divider" />

<p>
  If you believe this was done in error or you need your account reinstated,
  please contact your system administrator or supervisor directly.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #90a4ae;">
  Your data and history remain intact and will be accessible once your account is reactivated.
</p>
